"g|en|A2|Enough sebagai adverbia, determiner, pronomina":[["This soup is hot enough.","","Sup ini cukup panas.","enough","cukup"],["I don't have enough money.","","Saya tidak punya cukup uang.","enough","cukup"],["Is the room big enough for us?","","Apakah ruangan ini cukup besar untuk kami?","enough","cukup"],["We have enough chairs for everyone.","","Kami punya cukup kursi untuk semua orang.","enough","cukup"],["She isn't tall enough to reach the shelf.","","Dia tidak cukup tinggi untuk menjangkau rak itu.","enough","cukup"],["He didn't study hard enough for the test.","","Dia tidak belajar cukup keras untuk ujian itu.","enough","cukup"],["There isn't enough time to finish this today.","","Tidak ada cukup waktu untuk menyelesaikan ini hari ini.","enough","cukup"],["Are you warm enough, or should I close the window?","","Apakah kamu cukup hangat, atau perlu saya tutup jendelanya?","enough","cukup"],["This jacket is old, but it is good enough for me.","","Jaket ini sudah tua, tetapi cukup bagus untukku.","enough","cukup"],["We bought enough food for the whole weekend.","","Kami membeli cukup makanan untuk sepanjang akhir pekan.","enough","cukup"],["The boy ran quickly enough to catch the last bus.","","Anak lelaki itu berlari cukup cepat untuk mengejar bus terakhir.","enough","cukup"],["I think we have enough people to start the game.","","Saya rasa kami punya cukup orang untuk memulai permainan.","enough","cukup"],["She speaks English clearly enough for everyone to understand.","","Dia berbicara bahasa Inggris cukup jelas agar semua orang mengerti.","enough","cukup"],["Nobody had enough courage to tell the manager about the mistake.","","Tidak ada yang cukup berani memberi tahu manajer tentang kesalahan itu.","enough","cukup"],["The apartment is cheap, but it is not big enough for a family of five.","","Apartemen itu murah, tetapi tidak cukup besar untuk keluarga beranggotakan lima orang.","enough","cukup"]],
